    {
      "id": "swamp-trekking",
      "title": "Swamp trekking",
      "anchor": "Swamp_trekking",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "swamp-trekking:1nvifhm",
          "html": "Obtain a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Druid_pouch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Druid pouch</a> with at least six items in it. It is required for the section below. The <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ouroboros_pouch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ouroboros pouch</a> will not work.",
          "text": "Obtain a Druid pouch with at least six items in it. It is required for the section below. The Ouroboros pouch will not work.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "swamp-trekking:1nvifhm:eifgjv",
              "html": "It is required to have six as <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ghast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ghasts</a> will rot the items within the pouch.",
              "text": "It is required to have six as Ghasts will rot the items within the pouch.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "swamp-trekking:1nvifhm:17swynl",
              "html": "If you do not have charges in your druid pouch, make sure you have prayer points to cast bless to obtain more in the swamp.",
              "text": "If you do not have charges in your druid pouch, make sure you have prayer points to cast bless to obtain more in the swamp.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": [
                {
                  "type": "step",
                  "id": "swamp-trekking:1nvifhm:17swynl:fcfbkb",
                  "html": "You will need a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Silver_sickle_(b)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Silver sickle (b)</a> to cast bloom.",
                  "text": "You will need a Silver sickle (b) to cast bloom.",
                  "dialogue": [],
                  "images": [],
                  "tables": [],
                  "substeps": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "swamp-trekking:1ppt3fv",
          "html": "Go to Mort&#39;ton by either running through the swamp or using the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fairy_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fairy ring</a> <b>B</b><b>K</b><b>R</b> and taking the boat south-east of the fairy ring. Alternatively, use a portal at War&#39;s Retreat tuned to the Barrows Brothers for fast access.",
          "text": "Go to Mort'ton by either running through the swamp or using the fairy ring BKR and taking the boat south-east of the fairy ring. Alternatively, use a portal at War's Retreat tuned to the Barrows Brothers for fast access.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "the-hideout",
      "title": "The hideout",
      "anchor": "The_hideout",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hideout:tg6bec",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cyreg_Paddlehorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cyreg Paddlehorn</a>, before the bridge east of Mort&#39;ton.",
          "text": "Talk to Cyreg Paddlehorn, before the bridge east of Mort'ton.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Well, I guess they'll just die without weapons."
                },
                {
                  "key": "2",
                  "text": "Resourceful enough to get their own steel weapons?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "If you don't tell me, their deaths are on your head!"
                },
                {
                  "key": "3",
                  "text": "What kind of a man are you to say that you don't care?"
                },
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "Give wooden planks to Cyreg."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hideout:glx7kc",
          "html": "Use the boat to get to the Hollows.",
          "text": "Use the boat to get to the Hollows.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hideout:1hyixhm",
          "html": "Go north and climb up the strange tree. Look for a bridge on the map.",
          "text": "Go north and climb up the strange tree. Look for a bridge on the map.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hideout:13h1rml",
          "html": "Left click the bridge one step north, the bridge will break. Click it again to repair it. You can also right click and select Repair option. Repeat until the bridge is fully repaired (requires 75 steel nails and three planks).",
          "text": "Left click the bridge one step north, the bridge will break. Click it again to repair it. You can also right click and select Repair option. Repeat until the bridge is fully repaired (requires 75 steel nails and three planks).",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hideout:itqgze",
          "html": "Climb down, go just north-east to the hollow tree, and talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Curpile_Fyod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Curpile Fyod</a>. The questions are random. The answers to his question are as follows:",
          "text": "Climb down, go just north-east to the hollow tree, and talk to Curpile Fyod. The questions are random. The answers to his question are as follows:",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "1",
                  "text": "I've come to help the Myreque. I've brought weapons."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Question<br>Answer<br>Name the only female member of the Myreque.<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sani_Piliu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sani Piliu</a><br>Who is the leader of the Myreque?<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Veliaf_Hurtz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Veliaf Hurtz</a><br>What family is rumoured to rule Morytania?<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/House_Drakan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Drakan</a><br>Who is the youngest member of the Myreque?<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ivan_Strom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ivan Strom</a><br>Which member of the Myreque was originally a scholar?<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Polmafi_Ferdygris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Polmafi Ferdygris</a><br>What does Myreque mean?<br>Hidden in Myre<br>What is the boatman&#39;s name?<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cyreg_Paddlehorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cyreg Paddlehorn</a><br>Who was previously a scholar?<br><a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Polmafi_Ferdygris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Polmafi Ferdygris</a>"
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hideout:l5l6te",
          "html": "Open the doors on the rock behind the tree and follow the tunnel.",
          "text": "Open the doors on the rock behind the tree and follow the tunnel.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hideout:nx3yjs",
          "html": "Squeeze-past the stalagmite at the east wall, next to the stone brazier.",
          "text": "Squeeze-past the stalagmite at the east wall, next to the stone brazier.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hideout:1syy1x2",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Veliaf_Hurtz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Veliaf Hurtz</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to Veliaf Hurtz.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hideout:1g88ep6",
          "html": "Talk to all the other members, first dialogue will be enough.",
          "text": "Talk to all the other members, first dialogue will be enough.",
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "when": null,
              "options": [
                {
                  "key": "5",
                  "text": "Ok, thanks."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
